hpc:Hostclass a owl:Class .
hpc:statusproperty a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Hostclass ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:Okstatus a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Statusproperty .
hpc:Busystatus a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Statusproperty .
hpc:Lockwstatus a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Statusproperty .
hpc:Lockustatus a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Statusproperty .
hpc:Unavailstatus a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf hpc:Statusproperty .

hpc:Limclass a owl:Class .
hpc:runnablelim a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Limclass ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Hostclass .
hpc:unreachablelim a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Limclass ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Hostclass .

hpc:loadindex a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Hostclass .
hpc:runwindow a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Hostclass ;
    rdfs:range hpc:Runwindowclass .

hpc:Runwindowclass a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment defines classes for Host, Status, LIM, and RunWindow, as well as properties for describing the status of a host, the runnability of a LIM, the load index of a host, and the run window of a host. The properties are defined as object properties (for relationships between instances of classes) and datatype properties (for data values associated with instances of classes). The domain and range of each property are also specified.
